f the long-running conversation. Copilot constantly loses contextual awareness and as a result is pretty bad with follow up questions. It often replies as if it has no awareness of its previous response. But if you say \"look at your previous response and try again\" it gives you the answer you were looking for.\r\n\r\nPlease, please improve this. Copilot chat should _always_ respond in the context of previous messages rather than the other way around.","closed_by":{"login":"vs-code-engineering[bot]","id":122617954,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOB08AYg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/281319?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/vs-code-engineering","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/624/reactions","total_count":51,"+1":45,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":4,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/624/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/1837843435","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/624#issuecomment-1837843435","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/624","id":1837843435,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc5ti0Pr","user":{"login":"binaryfire","id":5361908,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNjE5MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5361908?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire","html_url":"https://github.com/binaryfire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-12-04T04:56:59Z","updated_at":"2023-12-04T04:58:23Z","body":"FYI here is some info on how OpenAI does it with ChatGPT: https://community.openai.com/t/how-to-preserve-the-context-session-of-a-conversation-with-the-api/324986/3\r\n\r\n> In the website version of ChatGPT, the contextual continuity is achieved through the resending of all prior messages for each new communication, ensuring the conversation maintains its coherence. \r\n\r\n> To replicate similar functionality through the API, developers must structure their API requests as a sequence of messages within a conversation. Each message in this sequence encompasses a “role” (system, user, or assistant) and “content” (the text of the message). By incorporating all prior messages within the conversation history while making API requests, developers provide the model with the essential context to produce relevant responses.\r\n\r\nDoes Copilot chat resend previous messages with each request?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/1837843435/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/1925836888","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/624#issuecomment-1925836888","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/624","id":1925836888,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc5yyfBY","user":{"login":"binaryfire","id":5361908,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNjE5MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5361908?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire","html_url":"https://github.com/binaryfire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryfire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-04T17:03:41Z","updated_at":"2024-02-04T17:05:37Z","body":"This is still an iss